   "note": "M1B-0T / BOR-DEC-143: RLS policies on products, orders, order_items, agent_audit_log and the tax surfaces call has_role(). Policy expressions are evaluated with the privileges of the querying role, so anon and authenticated MUST hold EXECUTE or every storefront read of those tables fails with 'permission denied for function has_role'. The routine is SECURITY DEFINER, read-only, and returns a boolean for the supplied user id only."
